# Same rules in every Nexus repository: LF in Git and on disk, CRLF only where Windows requires it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# NuGet rewrites its lock files with the platform's line ending (CRLF on Windows) at every restore: checked out the
# same way, a restore leaves the tree clean. Git still stores LF, so Dependabot's Linux restore changes nothing.
packages.lock.json text eol=crlf
